        <mxCell id="iaKIJlxI15cZCpAoIllr-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;这里系统信息中还要加入&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;Before starting any multi-&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;step task, use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;todo_write to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;plan your steps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
